# About pages

These are all the About pages that Lagrange uses to display built-in or dynamically generated content.

=> about:blank
A blank page.

=> about:bookmarks
List of bookmarks.

=> about:bookmarks?created
List of bookmarks with creation dates.

=> about:bookmarks?tags
List of bookmarks that have at least one tag.

=> about:debug
Runtime debug information: contents of currently open tabs, navigation history, environment variables, command line arguments, and configured tools.

=> about:feeds
List of all entries from subscribed feeds.

=> about:fonts
Installed fonts, and actions for viewing and managing fontpacks.

=> about:help
User guide.

=> about:lagrange
Default home page with a large "Lagrange" ASCII art logo.

=> about:licenses
Open source licenses.

=> about:protocols
Cheatsheets for the Gemini and Titan protocols.

=> about:reference
Technical reference: runtime files, configuration files, content filters, fontpacks, and user data archives.

=> about:version
Release notes for each version.
